# Output of the three terminal recordings used in assets/demo/weekly-digest-agent (asciinema, real runs, not the proof runs). The daily cadence is used so a run takes minutes.

=== d1 schedule
$ npm run -s weekly-digest-agent -- --wallet 0xe7368221de15a7c5e0a50a95317b06e6d08c3861 --print-schedule
cadence weekly: cron "0 1 * * 1" (UTC)
run: npm run weekly-digest-agent -- --wallet 0xe7368221de15a7C5e0a50A95317B06E6d08C3861 --cadence weekly --state <file> --deliver discord
a run only builds a digest once per finished period; the rest say "already delivered" and exit 0, so a daily trigger is safe.
$ 
